{"name":"Braintree","hex":"#65635b","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Braintree","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A town in Essex, England .","A local government district in Essex, formed in 1974, with its headquarters in the town."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Braintree"}],"entries":[{"title":"Braintree, Essex","blocks":[{"text":"Braintree is a town in Essex, England. At the 2021 census the built up area as defined by the Office for National Statistics had a population of 43,190. It is the largest settlement in the Braintree District, which also covers an extensive surrounding area."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8e/Fountain%2C_Braintree_-_geograph.org.uk_-_7267971.jpg/330px-Fountain%2C_Braintree_-_geograph.org.uk_-_7267971.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Braintree%2C_Essex","wikidata":"Q676067"},{"title":"Braintree District","blocks":[{"text":"Braintree District is a local government district in Essex, England. The district is named after the town of Braintree, where the council is based. The district also includes the towns of Halstead and Witham and surrounding rural areas."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Braintree_Town_Hall_Centre%2C_Fairfield_Road%2C_Braintree_-_geograph.org.uk_-_59709.jpg/330px-Braintree_Town_Hall_Centre%2C_Fairfield_Road%2C_Braintree_-_geograph.org.uk_-_59709.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Braintree_District","wikidata":"Q897454"},{"title":"Braintree (company)","blocks":[{"text":"Braintree is an American company that primarily deals in mobile and web payment systems for e-commerce companies. The company was acquired by PayPal on September 26, 2013."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Braintree_(company)","wikidata":"Q4955939"},{"title":"Braintree (constituency)","blocks":[{"text":"Braintree is a constituency in Essex represented in the House of Commons of the UK Parliament since 2015 by James Cleverly, a member of the Conservative Party."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/25/East_of_England_-_Braintree_constituency.svg/330px-East_of_England_-_Braintree_constituency.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Braintree_(constituency)","wikidata":"Q1072715"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Braintree_Library_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1037742.jpg/500px-Braintree_Library_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1037742.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Braintree_Library_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1037742.jpg/500px-Braintree_Library_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1037742.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABraintree_Library_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1037742.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/Braintree_Town_Hall.jpg/500px-Braintree_Town_Hall.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/Braintree_Town_Hall.jpg/1280px-Braintree_Town_Hall.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/Braintree_Town_Hall.jpg/500px-Braintree_Town_Hall.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABraintree_Town_Hall.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Freeport_Braintree_-_geograph.org.uk_-_646320.jpg/500px-Freeport_Braintree_-_geograph.org.uk_-_646320.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_c